              <br>
        <p>With all inserts determined to be around the expected ~3000 bp, we then proceeded with Gibson assembly and transformation. We plated 2 transformed <i>E. coli </i> Nissle Δlpp (Braun's lipoprotein knockouts) cultures, 1 transformed <i>E. coli </i> Nissle without Δlpp culture, and untransformed negative controls on kanamycin-resistance selection media.</p>
