      <p>
        In the early stages of development, the design focused on exploring different reactor types and defining the workflow for implementing the wet lab plan. We established a general direction: the system would require a <span class="span">perchlorate reduction chamber</span> (<i>E.coli </i>) and a <span class="span">desalination chamber</span> (<i>Synechococcus</i>).
      </p>
